# Copy this file to  secrets.local  and paste your key(s) in.
#
#     cp secrets.local.example secrets.local
#
# secrets.local is gitignored — it stays on your machine and is never
# committed or pushed. The app reads it automatically; no export needed.
#
# Two keys, both free, and the app runs fine with neither. Everything
# else — MLB scores, weather, lineups, NFL and CFB schedules, live scores,
# UFC fighter data — needs no key at all.

# Free key from https://the-odds-api.com
# Real sportsbook lines. Without it nothing is ever recommended, because
# nothing is recommended against a made-up price.
ODDS_API_KEY=

# Free app registration at https://developer.yahoo.com — ONLY needed if you
# play in a Yahoo fantasy league. Any app name, permission "Fantasy Sports
# read". These two identify the APP, not you: on their own they cannot read
# anybody's league, because a human still has to approve it on Yahoo's own
# screen. That approval is what this app stores, and you can revoke it from
# your Yahoo account page at any time. No password is ever shared.
YAHOO_CLIENT_ID=
YAHOO_CLIENT_SECRET=

# Free key from https://collegefootballdata.com/key
# The college RECRUITING layer: composites, blue-chip ratio, returning
# production, the transfer portal. It matters most in September, when a
# team's own results are two games against opponents nobody has measured
# either. Without it the CFB model is results-only and says so.
CFBD_API_KEY=
